Regression test for RUST_LOG="" (set-but-empty) vs. unset — see
`resolve_filter_source` in `src/main.rs`. Uses `--dry-run`: a real `report`
shells out to `cargo-llvm-cov`, which reruns this crate's own test suite
(including this fixture) under instrumentation, recursing without bound.

```
$ RUST_LOG= jci-coverage report --dry-run
[..]INFO jci_coverage::report: report [..]
(dry run) would run: cargo llvm-cov --all-features --lcov --output-path coverage/lcov.info
(dry run) would write [..]coverage/lcov.info
(dry run) would run: cargo llvm-cov report --summary-only

```
